  "prefLabel": "Pdab 101.04 Manufacturer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pdab 101.04 \"Manufacturer\" means a manufacturer of prescription drugs that are distributed in the state. This term does not include a packager, repackager, labeler, or relabeler unless the packager, repackager, labeler, or relabeler sets the price or controls the price of the prescription drug.\n\nSource. #13500-A, eff 12-2-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pdab100-300.html"
